  "oneLiner": "A task-board domain built around ownership, capacity limits and persistent state.",
  "summary": "A C# coursework project implements three-column boards, task assignment, membership and ownership transfer through an in-process service layer backed by SQLite. A partial WPF desktop frontend exposes login, board browsing and column lists; the stronger case study is the rule-driven backend, not a complete modern web product.",
