    {
      "title": "Treat capacity as a rule of the column",
      "implementation": "Column rejects additions and incoming tasks when full and refuses a new capacity smaller than its existing task count.",
      "whyItMatters": "The same workload limit follows all callers; it does not depend on whether a UI button is disabled. This is a rationale inferred from the code.",
